! NX MCP Plugin — Hotkey button definitions
! ACCELERATOR is a valid keyword for .btn files (not supported in .men)
! Note (2026-09-19): earlier comments claimed "NX_MCP_HOVER_CAPTURE button removed ... deployed DLL did not register this action".
! That is outdated — the button is defined in nx_mcp_plugin.men, and ManagedPlugin.cs has registered
! (Action="NX_MCP_HOVER_CAPTURE") and dispatches it; it won't report "missing valid action".
! The feature itself (ContextMenuHandler.OnHoverCapture, based on UIAutomation) has not been runtime-verified.
VERSION 120
CREATE BUTTON_DEFINITIONS
